@ Account screen: name, header, previous / current / next code, labels -> 131x64 GROB.
@ Layout must match tools/hpgrob.py (big digits at x=11+17k (+6 after the 3rd), y=18).
@ The countdown (y=48..55) is drawn by DTICK.
\<< \-> name hdr pc code nc lbls
  \<<
    #131d #64d BLANK
    { #0d #0d } name 2 \->GROB REPL
    hdr 2 \->GROB DUP SIZE DROP #131d SWAP - #0d 2 \->LIST SWAP REPL
    "prev  " pc FMT7 + 9 CTXT
    1 6 FOR k
      k 1 - 17 * 11 + k 3 > 6 * + R\->B #18d 2 \->LIST
      DIGS code k k SUB NUM 47 - GET
      REPL
    NEXT
    "next  " nc FMT7 + 40 CTXT
    { #0d #56d } lbls REPL
  \>>
\>>
